  "body": "## What's Changed\n* 补齐 v0.2.16 文档与 parity 记录 by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/102\n* 修正历史验证证据投影与 parity 索引 by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/103\n* 收敛 CI 与 Release 质量门 by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/104\n* 接入 Policy-bound Runtime verification route by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/105\n* 加强物理执行与成本证据绑定 by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/106\n* chore: prepare v0.2.17 adopter release acceptance by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/107\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/compare/v0.2.16...v0.2.17",
